ActionMan-0.1 weights: research preview licence

Copyright (c) 2026 Shreyash Kumar Singh

The model weights in this repository (model.safetensors) are released for research and evaluation use only.

They were trained on data that includes Salesforce's xlam-function-calling-60k (CC-BY-4.0), whose dataset card states
"This release is for research purposes only." Commercial use of these weights is not permitted under this preview licence.

Other training data: Team-ACE/ToolACE (Apache-2.0) and NousResearch/hermes-function-calling-v1 (Apache-2.0).
Base model: answerdotai/ModernBERT-large (Apache-2.0).

The inference code in code/actionman/ is released under the MIT licence (see the GitHub repository).

THE WEIGHTS ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND.
